        <message_html><![CDATA[<p><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="baseline" border="" hspace="" vspace="" /></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"><em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em> </a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. The system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Action required: Refusal of dangerous work</span></p>
<p>A Refusal of dangerous work has been declared and requires your immediate action. Below is information regarding the case <strong>${number}</strong>:</p>
<p>Employee name: ${subject_person_hr_profile}</p>
<p>Where:&nbsp; ${inc_refusal_loc.name} ${hv_location_occurence}</p>
<p>When: ${inc_date_time} ${hv_date_of_occurence}</p>
<p>Details: ${inc_desc_circumens} ${refusal_reason} ${hv_indiv_inv_des}</p>
<p>Please click this <a href="${mail_script:hoc_ohsm_todo_link}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">link</a> to take action.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Occupational Health and Safety</strong></p>
<p>House of Commons</p>
<p>50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">th</span> floor <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Office: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>
<hr noshade="noshade" />
<p><a name="francais"></a><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Action requise: Refus d'ex&eacute;cuter un travail dangereux</span></p>
<p>Un Refus d'ex&eacute;cuter un travail dangereux a &eacute;t&eacute; d&eacute;clar&eacute; et n&eacute;cessite votre action imm&eacute;diate. Vous trouverez ci-dessous des informations concernant le cas <strong>${number}</strong> :</p>
<p>Nom de l'employ&eacute; : ${subject_person_hr_profile}</p>
<p>O&ugrave; :&nbsp; ${inc_refusal_loc.name} ${inc_location.name} ${hv_location_occurence}</p>
<p>Quand : ${inc_date_time} ${hv_date_of_occurence}</p>
<p>D&eacute;tails : ${inc_desc_circumens} ${refusal_reason} ${hv_indiv_inv_des}</p>
<p>Veuillez cliquer sur le <a href="${mail_script:hoc_ohsm_todo_link_fr}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">lien</a> suivant pour prendre action.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Merci,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Sant&eacute; et s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</strong></p>
<p>Chambre des communes</p>
<p>50 Rue O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">e</span> &eacute;tage <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Bureau: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>]]></message_html>
